read: POSE and the GRIPPER are reported SEPARATELY on purpose. The plan's
last column is a hard +/-1, so one flipped gripper decision per step adds
exactly 0.2857 to a whole-plan mean — indistinguishable from the largest
pose effect ever measured here. Earlier combined readings (paper.md 4g) mixed
the two and must be re-measured with this build.
